'''Krypto''' is a [[:Category:Rare|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 2]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
Its blade is green in color with a crystalline texture over it, resembling a shard of Kryptonite, hence the name. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black. 

==Trivia== 
*[https://www.roblox.com/users/35005687/profile/ Vipisland] and [https://www.roblox.com/users/31520859/profile/ sycool] are the creators of this knife.
*This knife, along with many other knives are from other Murder games.
*The description of this knife is: "It's Superbystander's only weakness!!!"<ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/159494489/The-Kryptoknife Model created by Vipisland]</ref><ref>[https://www.roblox.com/library/155572643/Ice-texture-Knife Texture by sycool]</ref>

